# Copy to `.npmrc` (which is gitignored) and set ERP_NPM_TOKEN in your environment/CI.
# Routes the @erp-platform scope to your PRIVATE registry. Never commit the real token.

@erp-platform:registry=https://YOUR-PRIVATE-NPM-REGISTRY/
//YOUR-PRIVATE-NPM-REGISTRY/:_authToken=${ERP_NPM_TOKEN}

# Examples of private registries:
#   GitHub Packages : https://npm.pkg.github.com/
#   Azure Artifacts : https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/<org>/_packaging/<feed>/npm/registry/
#   Verdaccio (self) : http://localhost:4873/
